<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Evans Withycombe cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Evans Withycombe cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it downgraded Evans Withycombe Residential Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Separately, Alex. Brown said it cut Evans Withycombe to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 3/8 to 21.</p>
</text>
